# Nouf-ex — CODEOWNERS
# Automatic reviewer assignment based on the files a PR touches. GitHub
# auto-requests review from the listed users/teams when a PR changes a
# matching path. See
#   https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repository/setting-up-collaboration-on-github-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Format: <pattern>   <owner>
# Patterns use GitHub path glob syntax. The LAST matching rule wins
# (so order matters — more specific rules should come after more general ones).

# === Default: maintainer review on every PR =============================
